 *
 * A NOTE, not a violation. `.main` is a programmatic focus target (`tabindex="-1"`), so
 * removing its ring is correct — and CSS alone cannot prove that, which is why this form
 * is reported and not enforced. The gate must stay green on this file.
 */

.main:focus {
  outline: none;
}
